<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar experts' weekly meeting seen routine.</title>
<headline>EU sugar experts' weekly meeting seen routine.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar experts will exchange views on Wednesday in a continuing study of the calculations used to quantify the sugar content of manufactured products, an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The discussion will take place at an otherwise routine meeting following a decision on weekly and standing refunds,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
